  <h2>⚠️ Safety Caution: Camera Dummy Battery Warning</h2>
  <p>Many field monitors feature an auxiliary DC 8.4V output jack engineered to route power directly into your primary camera body via a dummy battery adapter cable. When implementing this workflow, invest exclusively in certified, branded dummy battery components featuring built-in voltage regulator protection circuits. Cheap third-party dummy adapters frequently leak voltage spikes during power cycling, which can permanently damage expensive internal camera motherboard chips.</p>

